      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "> **Test fixture.** It points at `titiler.test`, a host that does not resolve; the end-to-end suite intercepts its requests.\n\n# A band combination over a map someone already saved\n\nThe panel that matters here is one a user configured **before** the band dropdown existed: its saved map carries a `rasterTile` layer, on the true-colour preset, and its scene query returns a single row with no time column. Both are what the live dashboard has, and both used to break the dropdown — a composite drew nothing at all, and an index drew true colour."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "ubica-keplergl-panel",
      "title": "Saved raster layer",
      "gridPos": { "h": 16, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-testdata-datasource", "uid": "trlxrdZVk" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "grafana-testdata-datasource", "uid": "trlxrdZVk" },
          "refId": "A",
          "scenarioId": "raw_frame",
          "rawFrameContent": "[{\"schema\": {\"fields\": [{\"name\": \"acquired_at\", \"type\": \"string\"}, {\"name\": \"raster_url\", \"type\": \"string\"}, {\"name\": \"raster_item_url\", \"type\": \"string\"}]}, \"data\": {\"values\": [[\"2026-09-13\"], [\"https://example.test/scene-visual.tif\"], [\"https://example.test/items/scene-1\"]]}}]"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showSidePanel": false,
        "rasterServerUrl": "http://titiler.test",
        "rasterBands": "$bands",
        "mapConfig": {
          "version": "v1",
          "config": {
            "mapState": {
              "latitude": 0,
              "longitude": 0,
              "zoom": 4,
              "bearing": 0,
              "pitch": 0,
              "dragRotate": false
            },
            "visState": {
              "layerOrder": ["s2scene"],
              "layers": [
                {
                  "id": "s2scene",
                  "type": "rasterTile",
                  "config": {
                    "dataId": "grafana-A-raster",
                    "label": "Saved scene",
                    "isVisible": true,
                    "columns": {},
                    "visConfig": {
                      "colormapId": "cfastie",
                      "opacity": 1,
                      "preset": "trueColor",
                      "useSTACSearching": false
                    }
                  },
                  "visualChannels": {}
                }
